@node WEL "Introduction - (C) 1994 by Lightspeed Technologies"

   Welcome to this util released by Lightspeed Technologies!  Because the
   version of "Byteandi" has a little backdoor or something! We have made
   another one WITHOUT any backdoor or possibily to 'kill' your bbs.
   The sent-by versions of Byteandi (below 1.4) have a BIG BACKDOOR that
   can DELETE/FORMAT your harddisk!!
   We won't tell you how it is done, but be warned not to use older
   SendBy utilities.

>> It is simple a REPLACEMENT for the old autosent versions from byteandi <<
>> You need to install  the Fileid V1.5 and autosent first before you can <<
>> use this REPLACEMENT.                                                  <<


                                @{" BACK " LINK MAIN}
@endnode

@node REQ "Requirements - (C) 1994 by Lightspeed Technologies"

               The hardware and software you need to run:
               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

  - An Amiga with Kickstart 2.04++ (else /X 3.xx won't work)

  - The installed Ami-Express-Software (/X 3.20++)
  
  - Fileid V1.5, autosent V1.2 or higher.

  - AUTOconvert to convert old sent.dat files to the new ones.


                                @{" BACK " LINK MAIN}
@endnode

@node INS "Installation - (C) 1994 by Lightspeed Technologies"

                      Install it on your harddrive
                      ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  Installing it is very simple like this:
  
  - Use AUTOconvert to convert your old SENT.DAT to the new one.
  
  - copy the autosent over the old version.
  
  Now you are ready. Test it now and if it's not working 100% then must
  remove the SENT.DAT because you were not using the right one! Sorry but
  then all your users have to insert their tagline again. (Who carez,
  your bbs is 'save' again!!!)


                                @{" BACK " LINK MAIN}
@endnode

